<h1>Architecture</h1>

<p>
  SvelteKit owns routing, rendering, and the build. SvelteX owns application
  composition: modules, dependency injection, and lifecycle.
</p>

<ul>
  <li>src/lib/server/sveltex.ts creates the application instance.</li>
  <li>src/lib/server/modules/index.ts registers server modules.</li>
  <li>src/hooks.server.ts composes the SvelteX handle with SvelteKit sequence().</li>
  <li>sveltex.config.ts holds the canonical application configuration.</li>
</ul>

<p><a href="{{DOCS_URL}}" rel="noreferrer">Official SvelteX documentation</a></p>

